  "glibc_runtime_requirement": "readelf confirms the Subfaster Linux ELF requests /lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2 and NEEDED libc.so.6; the portable payload includes the interpreter, libc.so.6, libm.so.6, and libgcc_s.so.1.",
  "replacement_integrity_contract": "The app bundle verifier checks per-file hashes and an embedded manifest SHA. Directly replacing a library in the existing ZIP is rejected. A modified runtime requires the exact corresponding source, rebuilding the runtime, regenerating payload manifest and per-file hashes, and rebuilding ASM Tool from source with the new manifest SHA injected into internal/app.BundleManifestSHA256. This preserves fail-closed payload verification; no runtime override is added. Applicable LGPL/GCC exception notices and source must remain available.",
